# cards: equipping a card and a dragon ring from the Item page (docs/plan-cards.md 2.2). Jian has the Quetzalcoatl
# and Sasquatch cards and the Blazing Ring in the bag. Items, Cards (bottom row, second): the equip page opens
# (state 0x24, then 0x1A); A slots the first card (slot 5 = 236), which stays listed; Down highlights the next
# card and the box shows Quetzalcoatl as worn (shot em_cards_worn); A swaps in Sasquatch (slot 5 = 250). B, Accessories: Right to the
# Blazing Ring (the box compares it with the empty ring slot, shot em_ring_box), A puts it in slot 6 (0xCB) and
# the accessory (Counter Prototype, 0xD0) stays. Quetzalcoatl has 1500 of its 2000 points (0x020B48AC), which the
# box shows as 1500/2000 (shot em_cards); Sasquatch, a boss card, shows none. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
wait 100
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u8 0x0213BA29 1
poke u8 0x0213B9FA 1
poke u16 0x020B48AC 1500
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
watch u16 0x020B46A0 jian_slot4
watch u16 0x020B46A2 jian_slot5
watch u16 0x020B46A4 jian_slot6
press X 3
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot em_cards
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 40
shot em_cards_worn
press A 8
wait 60
shot em_cards_swapped
press B 8
wait 60
press Up 8
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 20
press Right 8
wait 20
press Right 8
wait 20
press Right 8
wait 30
shot em_categories
press A 8
wait 60
shot em_acc
press Right 8
wait 30
shot em_ring_box
press A 8
wait 60
shot em_ring_on
peek u16 0x020B46A0 jian_slot4_end
peek u16 0x020B46A2 jian_slot5_end
peek u16 0x020B46A4 jian_slot6_end
